From a3462d020787c4bbe895906daf9a85911cad36d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:43:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] test(import): restore main's STEP pins on the solidcore
 branch

The branch had made the STEP import pins weaker. Each test file gets
its text from origin/main again. Only the call to the removed truck
wrapper step::with_face_eval_cap is dropped; the call inside it stays.
These pins fail now and record what the solidcore path changes.

Refs #917

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
